    1. MEDICAL DISCLAIMER, now at the TOP
    2. one combined row: brand + all six links + copyright

  Previously three blocks - brand/links, then disclaimer, then a bottom bar with
  the legal links. Splitting the links across two separated rows meant the
  footer had two link groups doing the same job at opposite ends, with the
  disclaimer wedged between them. Jon: "combine the two sections of links".

  Podcast link REMOVED 2026-08-21 (Jon). Not pursuing podcasting: "people wont
