      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* One row: brand, then every link, then the copyright. The two nav groups
      stay separate elements so screen readers still hear "Work with Jon" and
      "Legal" as distinct groupings, but they sit on one line visually. */}
  <div class="footer__bottom">
    <div class="wrap footer__bar">
